 \section{Full-History Parameter Estimates}\label{app:parameters}
 Tables~\ref{tab:specifications} and~\ref{tab:coefficients} summarize the August 2026 full-history fits. These are the separate outlook models, not a fixed specification imposed on the rolling-origin backtest. Structures and parameters were re-estimated at every historical origin. Variances and coefficients refer to the transformed response $\log(1+X_t)$.
